WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.191
Ayiwa, tere bɔra tuma min na, kongowara nana ni kongosogo minw bɛɛ ye kongo kɔnɔ, a tun ka olugu bɛɛ wele ka na domuni kɛ.

00:00:10.271 --> 00:00:18.694
O y'a sɔrɔ o cɛ kunkolo tun tɛmɛna bonkɔnɔyɔrɔ dɔ kan, ani a kɔnɔbara belebeleba tun lanin bɛ a kɔnɔ.

00:00:18.774 --> 00:00:21.724
O tuma na, o ye ɲamaɲaman tɔgɔba ye!

00:00:21.804 --> 00:00:25.513
O kɔ, kongowara pɛrɛnna, yiritu bɛɛ murutira.

00:00:25.593 --> 00:00:32.079
A ka kan ka tere caman kɔnɔni kɛ ni a kɔnɔbara lakolon ye, sani a ye se ka bɔ.

00:00:32.159 --> 00:00:36.373
O wagati ra, sagaw tun bɛ domuni kɛ ni kɔngɔtɔw ye.

00:00:36.453 --> 00:00:40.498
Mɔgɔw b'a fɔ ko kabi o wagati, u b'u yɛrɛ majigi.
